    },
    {
      "id": "claim_958f9e969760457fa8b561832163d787",
      "statement": "The agent image contributes the runtime rather than the setup: the pinned Pi package, a small tool set, the entrypoint, and PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR=/pi/agent with PI_WORKSPACE=/workspace, and no USER directive because the uid is negotiated per run.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L59-L64",
