    },
    {
      "id": "claim_26a9c7971a0e405bb6ce22d56feca9d3",
      "statement": "The entrypoint runs the same preparation for both modes and then execs what it was given, so --shell sessions get the writable HOME and git safe.directory fix that agent sessions get.",
