    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4216a29f083f4d8f9b3a3bab4f7ad217",
      "statement": "Everything a session knows about its configuration arrives through two read-write bind mounts — the project at /workspace and the repository's agent/ directory at /pi/agent — so committed agent setup travels with the repository rather than being baked into an image.",
